  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃、調子が悪いのか？\r\nふらついてるぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "平気です\r\nほわわわ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり調子が悪いんじゃないか？\r\n今日のレッスンは終わりにしよう",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、次のオーディションも近いですし、\r\nレッスンしたいです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "レッスンさせてください\r\nお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃、ずいぶん熱心だな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "最近、応援してくれる人が増えたんです\r\n道を歩いてて声をかけられたりすることも",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "学校のみんなからも、\r\n『頑張って』って言われるようになりました",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、真乃はアイドルとしてどんどん伸びてるからな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みんなの応援に応えたいって、思うんです\r\nできるだけ大勢の人に喜んでもらいたいって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今までの私は、自分がどこを歩いているのかも\r\nよくわかっていませんでした",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今もまだ、どこへ向かえばいいのかよくわかりません\r\nでも、どこかへ飛んでいけそうなんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃がそう感じてるのはいいことだけど……",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "すごく……わくわくしているんです、私\r\nだから、やれることは全部やっておきたくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、\r\nいつもみたいに背中を押してください！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040110"
  },
  {
    "select": "今日のレッスンは\r\n終わりだ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "でも真乃が心配なんだよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "その意気だ、真乃！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040120,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そんな……どうしてですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃はみんなを癒してくれるアイドルだ\r\nそんな真乃自身が傷つくことは誰も望んでない",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃を休ませることが、\r\n俺なりの背中の押し方なんだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ……\r\nそう、だったんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺や学校の友達が一番望んでることが何か\r\n真乃ならわかるはずだよ？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……みんな私を大切にしてくれてます\r\nその私が傷ついてちゃダメですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それに……傷ついた翼ではうまく飛べない\r\n灯織ちゃんやめぐるちゃんに迷惑はかけたくないです",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、真乃はファンや仲間、友達のことを\r\n本当に想ってるんだね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はい\r\nみんな、とっても……とっても大切な人たちですっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今日は帰って休むことにしますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、大切なことに気付かせてくれて\r\n……いつも、ありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040190,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "心配してくれてありがとうございます\r\nプロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも私は……もっと頑張って\r\nみんなの期待に応えたいって思うんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "期待か……\r\nみんなが真乃に望んでることってなんだろう？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みなさんが望んでいること……\r\n前にプロデューサーさんが教えてくれたのは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "癒し……？\r\n私を見て癒されるって、教えてくれました",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよ\r\n思い出してくれたね",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ……それなら、\r\nみなさんに心配かけちゃいけません",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "心配してたら、癒されないです……\r\nもっと安心してもらわないと",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お休みすることも大事ですね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも私だけお休みしていたら、\r\n灯織ちゃんやめぐるちゃんの足を引っ張ってしまうかも……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "身体を休めてても、できることはあると思うよ\r\nレッスンしてるところ、ビデオに撮ってるんだよね？",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、後から見たらいいお勉強になるんですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ほわっ、そっか\r\nお休みしている時はビデオで復習すればいいんですね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040290,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん\r\nまた助けてくれましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040300,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、もっともっとレッスン頑張りますっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ、倒れるまで頑張れ！",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040310,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、倒れるまで……",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040320,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわぁ、倒れたら……ダメです……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040330,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "もしお仕事ができなかったら、\r\n応援してくれているみなさんを悲しませてしまいます……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040340,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "灯織ちゃんやめぐるちゃん、プロデューサーさんに\r\n迷惑をかけてしまうし……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだね、よく気付いてくれた\r\n無茶をしすぎちゃいけないんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040350,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんの言う通り、レッスンはお休みしますね\r\nでも……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、今日は他の子のレッスンを見学しようか\r\nきっといろんな発見があるはずだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040360,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ、そういう勉強の仕方もあるんですね\r\nじゃあ、今日は見学しますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100104/1001001040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001001040370,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんありがとうございます\r\nこれからもよろしくお願いしますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
